EINVOICING_AP_PRECHECK_MANUEL=Validation manuelle
EINVOICING_AP_PRECHECK_AUTO=Automatic remote validation after e-invoice generation
EINVOICING_AP_PRECHECK_HELP=After an e-invoice is generated, you can request a remote service provided by your Access Point to check if the invoice is valid.
